OL,5,G1755 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FNick and his best friend Layla
OL,7,     Fwelcome their rivals to The New
OL,8,     FInn in St John's Wood, London. But
OL,9,     Fguests John and Sue are left cold
OL,10,     Fby their 'corporate and
OL,11,     Fimpersonal' room.
OL,12,G1825 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FAt The Bunkroom in Chester, David
OL,14,     Fis determined to prove that
OL,15,     Fhostelling is for everyone - even
OL,16,     Fif his wife isn't convinced. What
OL,17,     Fwill the guests make of the bunk
OL,18,     Fbeds and budget breakfast?
